AB  - This is the precedent study on the modern fashion design using the Korean emotion, aiming to study the expressions in the modern fashion based on ‘Jeong-Jung-Dong’ idea from Korean dancing which implicates the Korean emotion deeply among the artworks to have the essence similar to the clothing. The unique idea ‘Jeong-Jung-Dong’ in the Korean traditional dancing is the philosophy to involve the paradox expression, ‘Movement in Silence,’ which had been representing the emotion of Korean dancing for a long time. The main characteristics deducted in ‘Jeong-Jung-Dong’ were 1) incomplete and complete by atypical, 2) the beauty of margin by symbolism, and 3) amusing mutual relationship. Upon the analysis results of previous studies on the expressions in the modern fashion with ‘Jeong-Jung-Dong,’ they demonstrated atypical expressed by the metaphor, symbolic expression through temperance, and mutual relational table by harmony. The analysis of modern fashion expression by ‘Jeong-Jung-Dong’ which is a philosophical idea in the Korean dancing could highlight the new viewpoint to see the clothing and systemize the theory on the Korean emotion to seek the effective expression of artistic features for the culture together with introduction of our unique emotion in the creative design process by understanding of humanitarian and philosophical ideologies to be utilized in the future Fashion Design.
